paper-scraper-doi
=================

This project is based on and extends GAO-pooh/paper-scraper:

  https://github.com/GAO-pooh/paper-scraper/tree/main

The original project is licensed under the MIT License and includes:

  Copyright (c) 2026 GAO-pooh

This repository keeps the original MIT License and adds modifications by:

  Copyright (c) 2026 wkguoo (modifications)

Major changes in this repository include Windows-focused UI packaging,
ScienceDirect DOI batch intake and reporting, Cookie JSON support,
supplementary-material reporting, an open-access resource discovery and
download-assistance workflow, and Codex Skills for assisted local operation.

This tool does not provide access rights, bypass publisher or institutional
permissions, solve CAPTCHA challenges, or use shadow libraries. Users are
responsible for complying with their institution, publisher, database, and
local policy requirements. This project does not provide legal advice.
